OL,3,GNEWSASilent disco group 'brilliant for
OL,4,Athe body and soul'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz Bevins was at her "absolute lowest"
OL,7,Fabout six months ago while going
OL,8,Fthrough the perimenopause.
OL,10,FLiz, 47, from Coalville in
OL,11,FLeicestershire, decided to start
OL,12,Fheading out on walks while listening to
OL,13,Fmusic to try to help her mental health.
OL,15,FWhile on one of those walks earlier
OL,16,Fthis summer, she had a lightbulb moment
OL,17,Fand decided to "take a gamble" to try
OL,18,Fto introduce the activity to more women
OL,19,Fby starting her own group.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
