OL,3,GNEWSASilent disco group 'brilliant for
OL,4,Athe body and soul'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnly a few months later, dozens now
OL,7,Fjoin Liz for a sing and a dance as part
OL,8,Fof her women's-only silent disco
OL,9,Fwalking group - Shake Up Coalville.
